@startuml
actor "Оператор" as Operator
participant "FraudGuardFrame\n(Swing UI)" as UI
participant "FraudGuardService" as Service
participant "CsvCodec" as CSV
participant "ScoringEngine" as Engine
participant "ReportWriter" as Reports

Operator -> UI: Нажать «Старт ленты»
UI -> Service: analyze(transactions, history, output)
Service -> CSV: loadTransactions(history)
CSV --> Service: history + validation errors
Service -> CSV: loadTransactions(transactions)
CSV --> Service: valid transactions + errors
Service -> Engine: scoreAll(history, transactions)
Engine --> Service: scored results
Service -> Reports: writeBatchReports(results, errors)
Reports --> Service: отчёты записаны
Service --> UI: AnalysisResult

loop Для каждой строки с заданным интервалом
  UI -> UI: Добавить запись в живую ленту
  alt decision = REVIEW
    UI -> UI: Добавить запись в очередь проверки
    Operator -> UI: Одобрить / Отклонить
    UI -> Reports: writeOperatorDecisions(rows)
    Reports --> UI: журнал сохранён
  else decision = APPROVE или BLOCK
    UI -> UI: Отобразить авто-статус
  end
end
@enduml
